Subject: [PATCH 21/43] P1: nested parallel loops inline during serial items
 (deadlock fix); P1 v3 crashing aircraft that cannot land this frame in
 parallel, trails deferred in loop order (toggle bit 3); H72 anim checksum
 only with SYNCCHECK

